<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">2 John</book>
  <para style="h">2 John</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 John</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 John</para>
  <para style="mt">2 John</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Upa chuan, Hmeichhe ṭha thlan leh a fate hnênah: Thutak, keimahnia awm reng, kumkhua pawha kan hnêna awm tûr avâng hian tihtak zetin ka hmangaih che u a ni; kei chang ka ni lo ve, thutak chu hria apiang pawhin a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pa, Pathian leh Pa Fapa, Isua Krista hnên ata khawngaihna te, zahngaihna te, remna te chu, thutak leh hmangaihnain kan hnênah a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pa hnên ata thupêk kan hmuh ang khân i fa, tute emaw thutaka awmin ka hmuh avângin ka lâwm hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hmeichhe ṭha, i hnênah thupêk thar ziak ang ni lovin, a tîr ata kan neih ang kha ziak zâwkin, kan inhmangaih tawnna tûrin ka ngên chiam a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, hei hi hmangaihna a ni, ama thupêk ang zêla kan awm hi. Thupêk, a tîr ata in hriat ang chu hei hi a ni, chumiah chuan in awm tûr chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bumtu tam tak - Isua Krista chu tisain a lo kal tih ṭan lotute kha - khawvêlah hian an lo chhuak ta si a. Chutiang mi chu a ni, bumtu leh Krista dodâltu chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kan thawh chhuah sate kha in hloh lohva, a man chu a kima in hmuh theih zâwk nân invêng ṭha rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu pawh Krista zirtîrna thûa awm reng lova, kal pel chuan Pathian a nei lo ve. Chumi zirtîrna thûa awm reng erawh chuan, chu mi ngei chuan Pa leh Fapa a nei kawp a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu pawh chumi zirtîrna thu chu rawn keng lovin in hnênah lo kal sela, in inah thlentîr suh ula, ṭawngkam ṭha pawhin thlah suh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ṭawngkam ṭhaa thlahtu chu a thil tihsualah chuan a tel ve si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In hnênah thu tam tak sawi tûr ka neih avângin lehkha leh lehkhatuiin ziak ka duh lo ve; in lâwm a kim theih nân in hnêna lo kala, inhmatawna inbiak ka beisei zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I laizâwnnu thlana faten chibai an bûk a che.
  </para>
</usx>
